// The bignum package: `core/bigint` and `core/decimal`, the two numeric types
// that are not one machine word. Everything it asserts lives in `test/`; the
// library itself has no exports, because what is under test is the two standard
// library modules rather than any code here.
//
// One package for two modules because they answer one question between them —
// what to reach for when an `Int` is the wrong shape — and because the two
// files share nothing else: a `BigInt` grows, and a `Decimal` puts a point in
// one `Int`.
